// ================= SL HIT DETECTION & TAGS =======================================
// =================================================================================
// SL hit logic: track the last known SL levels (buy and sell sides) per option.
// A BUY SL hit fires when price crosses BELOW the computed SL of a recent BUY signal.
// A SELL SL hit fires when price crosses ABOVE the computed SL of a recent SELL signal.
// We track each option's entry price (LTP at signal bar) and SL level using var floats.
// When spot crosses that SL level on a subsequent bar, tag is drawn on the chart.
// Only active while showSLHitTags = true.

// ── CE ATM SL tracker ──
var float ce_atm_buy_sl  = na   // SL level for last CE ATM buy signal
var float ce_atm_sell_sl = na   // SL level for last CE ATM sell signal

